\n            at com.google.android.exoplayer.extractor.mp4.AtomParsers.parseStbl(AtomParsers.java:116)\n            at com.google.android.exoplayer.extractor.mp4.Mp4Extractor.processMoovAtom(Mp4Extractor.java:235)\n            at com.google.android.exoplayer.extractor.mp4.Mp4Extractor.readAtomPayload(Mp4Extractor.java:208)\n            at com.google.android.exoplayer.extractor.mp4.Mp4Extractor.read(Mp4Extractor.java:103)\n            at com.google.android.exoplayer.extractor.ExtractorSampleSource$ExtractingLoadable.load(ExtractorSampleSource.java:616)\n            at com.google.android.exoplayer.upstream.Loader$LoadTask.run(Loader.java:209)\n            at java.util.concurrent.Executors$RunnableAdapter.call(Executors.java:422)\n            at java.util.concurrent.FutureTask.run(FutureTask.java:237)\n            at java.util.concurrent.ThreadPoolExecutor.runWorker(ThreadPoolExecutor.java:1112)\n            at java.util.concurrent.ThreadPoolExecutor$Worker.run(ThreadPoolExecutor.java:587)\n            at java.lang.Thread.run(Thread.java:841)\n```\n\nI am using the latest dev version of Exoplayer with the Mp4Extractor.\nAny explanations about this exception ? \nThanks a lot\n","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/google/ExoPlayer/issues/554/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/google/ExoPlayer/issues/554/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed"}},"event":"cross-referenced"},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/google/ExoPlayer/issues/comments/114684296","html_url":"https://github.com/google/ExoPlayer/issues/576#issuecomment-114684296","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/google/ExoPlayer/issues/576","id":114684296,"node_id":"MDEyOklzc3VlQ29tbWVudDExNDY4NDI5Ng==","user":{"login":"srikieonline","id":12011818,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEyMDExODE4","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/12011818?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/srikieonline","html_url":"https://github.com/srikieonline","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/srikieonline/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/srikieonline/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/srikieonline/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/srikieonline/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/srikieonline/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/srikieonline/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/srikieonline/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/srikieonline/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/srikieonline/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2015-06-24T00:48:23Z","updated_at":"2015-06-24T00:48:23Z","body":"The content has 2 audio tracks : one for MP3 and other is Dolby. \n\nThe issue is as follows:\n\nIn parseAudioSampleEntry function, after parsing ESDS box, it does not check the ObjectTypeIndication of DecoderConfigDescriptor , and assumes its as AAC (0x40), and as per Audio ISO/IEC 14496-3 goes ahead and tries to use util.parseAudioSpecificConfig to parse out the channel Count and Sampling Frequency. This leads to index out of bounds exception because it assumes a minimum of 2 bytes of config data - whereas only 1 byte is present.\n\nIn these content, the ObjectTypeIndication is actually 0x6B which is corresponding to MP3 (i.e Audio ISO/IEC 11172-3) as per ISO-IEC-14496-1.\n\nCode reference:\n1. parseAudioSampleEntry function:\nhttps://github.com/google/ExoPlayer/blob/master/library/src/main/java/com/google/android/exoplayer/extractor/mp4/AtomParsers.java#L512\n1. Call to parseAudioSpecificConfig without checking value of ObjectTypeIndication\n   https://github.com/google/ExoPlayer/blob/master/library/src/main/java/com/google/android/exoplayer/extractor/mp4/AtomParsers.java#L515\n","author_association":"NONE","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/google/ExoPlayer/issues/comments/114684296/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"event":"commented","actor":{"login":"srikieonline","id":12011818,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEyMDExODE4","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/12011818?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/srikieonline","html_url":"https://github.com/srikieonline","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/srikieonline/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/srikieonline/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/srikieonline/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/srikieonline/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/srikieonline/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/srikieonline/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/srikieonline/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/srikieonline/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/srikieonline/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false}},{"id":338663784,"node_id":"MDEyOkxhYmVsZWRFdmVudDMzODY2Mzc4NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/google/ExoPlayer/issues/events/338663784","actor":{"login":"ojw28","id":7881572,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc4ODE1NzI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7881572?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojw28","html_url":"https://github.com/ojw28","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojw28/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojw28/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojw28/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojw28/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojw28/s